  "segments": [
    {
      "id": "intro-1",
      "section": "intro",
      "text": "ಮಕ್ಕಳ ಮನಸ್ಸಿನಲ್ಲಿ ಕುತೂಹಲಭರಿತ ಪ್ರಶ್ನೆಗಳು ಹುಟ್ಟುತ್ತವೆ. ವಿವಿಧ ಕಲ್ಪನೆಗಳು ಕಾಣಿಸುತ್ತವೆ. ಹೊಸ ಹೊಸ ಕನಸುಗಳು ಗೂಡು ಕಟ್ಟುತ್ತವೆ. ಮಕ್ಕಳು ತಮ್ಮ ಕಲ್ಪನೆಯಲ್ಲಿ ನಿರ್ಜೀವ ವಸ್ತುಗಳೊಂದಿಗೂ ಮನಬಿಚ್ಚಿ ಮಾತಾಡಬಲ್ಲರು! ಅಪರಿಚಿತ ಸನ್ನಿವೇಶಗಳೂ ಸಹ ಅವರ ಕನಸುಗಳಲ್ಲಿ ಹತ್ತಿರಕ್ಕೆ ಬಂದುಬಿಡುತ್ತವೆ. ಹೀಗಿರುವ ಅವರ ಕಲ್ಪನೆಗಳಿಗೆ ಮತ್ತಷ್ಟು ಗರಿಗಳನ್ನು ಕಟ್ಟಿ ಇನ್ನಷ್ಟು ಎತ್ತರಕ್ಕೆ ಹಾರಲು ಪ್ರೋತ್ಸಾಹಿಸಿ ಆ ಮೂಲಕ ಪ್ರಸ್ತುತತೆಯ ಅರಿವು ಮೂಡಿಸುವುದು ಇಲ್ಲಿನ ಆಶಯವಾಗಿದೆ.",
      "translations": {
        "en": "Curious questions arise in children’s minds. Varied imaginings appear. New dreams nest. Children can even open their hearts and talk to lifeless things in imagination! Unfamiliar situations too come close in their dreams. The aim here is to add more wings to such imaginings, encourage them to fly higher, and thereby awaken awareness of the present.",
        "hi": "बच्चों के मन में कौतूहल भरे प्रश्न उठते हैं। विविध कल्पनाएँ दिखती हैं। नए सपने घोंसला बनाते हैं। कल्पना में निर्जीव वस्तुओं से भी मन खोलकर बात कर सकते हैं! अपरिचित स्थितियाँ भी सपनों में पास आ जाती हैं। ऐसी कल्पनाओं को और पंख देकर ऊँचा उड़ने को प्रोत्साहित कर वर्तमान का बोध जगाना—यही आशय है।"
      },
      "transliterations": {
        "devanagari": "मक्कळ मनस्सिनल्लि कुतूहलभरित प्रश्नॆगळु हुट्टुत्तवॆ. विविध कल्पनॆगळु काणिसुत्तवॆ. हॊस हॊस कनसुगळु गूडु कट्टुत्तवॆ. मक्कळु तम्म कल्पनॆयल्लि निर्जीव वस्तुगळॊंदिगू मनबिच्चि माताडबल्लरु! अपरिचित सन्निवेशगळू सह अवर कनसुगळल्लि हत्तिरक्कॆ बंदुबिडुत्तवॆ. हीगिरुव अवर कल्पनॆगळिगॆ मत्तष्टु गरिगळन्नु कट्टि इन्नष्टु ऎत्तरक्कॆ हारलु प्रोत्साहिसि आ मूलक प्रस्तुततॆय अरिवु मूडिसुवुदु इल्लिन आशयवागिदॆ.",
        "latin": "makkaḻa manassinalli kutūhalabharita praśnègaḻu huṭṭuttavè. vividha kalpanègaḻu kāṇisuttavè. hòsa hòsa kanasugaḻu gūḍu kaṭṭuttavè. makkaḻu tamma kalpanèyalli nirjīva vastugaḻòṃdigū manabicci mātāḍaballaru! aparicita sanniveśagaḻū saha avara kanasugaḻalli hattirakkè baṃdubiḍuttavè. hīgiruva avara kalpanègaḻigè mattaṣṭu garigaḻannu kaṭṭi innaṣṭu èttarakkè hāralu protsāhisi ā mūlaka prastutatèya arivu mūḍisuvudu illina āśayavāgidè."
      },
      "type": "prose"
    },
    {
      "id": "poem-s1l1",
      "section": "poem",
      "stanza": 1,
      "text": "ಆಗಸದಲ್ಲಿ ಹಾರುವುದೆಂದರೆ",
      "translations": {
        "en": "To fly in the sky",
        "hi": "आकाश में उड़ना"
      },
      "transliterations": {
        "devanagari": "आगसदल्लि हारुवुदॆंदरॆ",
        "latin": "āgasadalli hāruvudèṃdarè"
      },
      "type": "poem_line"
    },
    {
      "id": "poem-s1l2",
      "section": "poem",
      "stanza": 1,
      "text": "ಪುಟಾಣಿ ಪುಟ್ಟಿಗೆ ಬಲು ಇಷ್ಟ",
      "translations": {
        "en": "little Putti loves very much",
        "hi": "छोटी पुट्टी को बहुत पसंद"
      },
      "transliterations": {
        "devanagari": "पुटाणि पुट्टिगॆ बलु इष्ट",
        "latin": "puṭāṇi puṭṭigè balu iṣṭa"
      },
      "type": "poem_line"
    },
    {
      "id": "poem-s1l3",
      "section": "poem",
      "stanza": 1,
      "text": "ರೆಕ್ಕೆಗಳಿಲ್ಲದೆ ಹಾರಲು ಹೋದರೆ",
      "translations": {
        "en": "If she goes to fly without wings",
        "hi": "बिना पंख उड़ने जाए तो"
      },
      "transliterations": {
        "devanagari": "रॆक्कॆगळिल्लदॆ हारलु होदरॆ",
        "latin": "rèkkègaḻilladè hāralu hodarè"
      },
      "type": "poem_line"
    },
    {
      "id": "poem-s1l4",
      "section": "poem",
      "stanza": 1,
      "text": "ಆಗದೆ ತೊಂದರೆ? ಇದು ಕಷ್ಟ.",
      "translations": {
        "en": "it won’t work—trouble? This is hard.",
        "hi": "न हो—परेशानी? यह कठिन है।"
      },
      "transliterations": {
        "devanagari": "आगदॆ तॊंदरॆ? इदु कष्ट.",
        "latin": "āgadè tòṃdarè? idu kaṣṭa."
      },
      "type": "poem_line"
    },
    {
      "id": "poem-s2l1",
      "section": "poem",
      "stanza": 2,
      "text": "ಒಂದಿನ ಇದ್ದಕ್ಕಿದ್ದಂತೆ",
      "translations": {
        "en": "One day all of a sudden",
        "hi": "एक दिन अचानक"
      },
      "transliterations": {
        "devanagari": "ऒंदिन इद्दक्किद्दंतॆ",
        "latin": "òṃdina iddakkiddaṃtè"
      },
      "type": "poem_line"
    },
    {
      "id": "poem-s2l2",
      "section": "poem",
      "stanza": 2,
      "text": "ಪುಟ್ಟಿಗೆ ರೆಕ್ಕೆಯು ಬಂದಿತ್ತು.",
      "translations": {
        "en": "wings came to Putti.",
        "hi": "पुट्टी को पंख आ गए।"
      },
      "transliterations": {
        "devanagari": "पुट्टिगॆ रॆक्कॆयु बंदित्तु.",
        "latin": "puṭṭigè rèkkèyu baṃdittu."
      },
      "type": "poem_line"
    },
    {
      "id": "poem-s2l3",
      "section": "poem",
      "stanza": 2,
      "text": "ಹಕ್ಕಿಯ ಹಾಗೆ ಹಾರುವ ಮನಕೆ",
      "translations": {
        "en": "To the mind that wanted to fly like a bird",
        "hi": "चिड़िया की तरह उड़ने वाले मन को"
      },
      "transliterations": {
        "devanagari": "हक्किय हागॆ हारुव मनकॆ",
        "latin": "hakkiya hāgè hāruva manakè"
      },
      "type": "poem_line"
    },
    {
      "id": "poem-s2l4",
      "section": "poem",
      "stanza": 2,
      "text": "ಹೆಚ್ಚಿನ ಹರುಷವ ತಂದಿತ್ತು.",
      "translations": {
        "en": "it brought greater joy.",
        "hi": "और अधिक हर्ष मिला।"
      },
      "transliterations": {
        "devanagari": "हॆच्चिन हरुषव तंदित्तु.",
        "latin": "hèccina haruṣava taṃdittu."
      },
      "type": "poem_line"
    },
    {
      "id": "poem-s3l1",
      "section": "poem",
      "stanza": 3,
      "text": "ಕೂಡಲೆ ಪುಟ್ಟಿ ಠಣ್ಣನೆ ಜಿಗಿದು",
      "translations": {
        "en": "At once Putti leaped with a thud",
        "hi": "तुरंत पुट्टी ठन से कूदी"
      },
      "transliterations": {
        "devanagari": "कूडलॆ पुट्टि ठण्णनॆ जिगिदु",
        "latin": "kūḍalè puṭṭi ṭhaṇṇanè jigidu"
      },
      "type": "poem_line"
    },
    {
      "id": "poem-s3l2",
      "section": "poem",
      "stanza": 3,
      "text": "ಆಗಸದೊಡಲಿಗೆ ಹಾರಿದಳು.",
      "translations": {
        "en": "and flew into the belly of the sky.",
        "hi": "आकाश की गोद में उड़ी।"
      },
      "transliterations": {
        "devanagari": "आगसदॊडलिगॆ हारिदळु.",
        "latin": "āgasadòḍaligè hāridaḻu."
      },
      "type": "poem_line"
    },
    {
      "id": "poem-s3l3",
      "section": "poem",
      "stanza": 3,
      "text": "ಹಾರುತ ತೇಲುತ ಮುಂದಕೆ ಸಾಗಿ",
      "translations": {
        "en": "Flying floating going onward",
        "hi": "उड़ती तैरती आगे बढ़"
      },
      "transliterations": {
        "devanagari": "हारुत तेलुत मुंदकॆ सागि",
        "latin": "hāruta teluta muṃdakè sāgi"
      },
      "type": "poem_line"
    },
    {
      "id": "poem-s3l4",
      "section": "poem",
      "stanza": 3,
      "text": "ಚಂದ್ರನ ಮಡಿಲನು ಸೇರಿದಳು.",
      "translations": {
        "en": "she reached the moon’s lap.",
        "hi": "चंद्र की गोद में पहुँची।"
      },
      "transliterations": {
        "devanagari": "चंद्रन मडिलनु सेरिदळु.",
        "latin": "caṃdrana maḍilanu seridaḻu."
      },
      "type": "poem_line"
    },
    {
      "id": "poem-s4l1",
      "section": "poem",
      "stanza": 4,
      "text": "ಚಂದ್ರನ ಮೇಲೆ ನೆಟ್ಟಗೆ ನಿಂತು",
      "translations": {
        "en": "Standing straight on the moon",
        "hi": "चंद्र पर सीधे खड़ी"
      },
      "transliterations": {
        "devanagari": "चंद्रन मेलॆ नॆट्टगॆ निंतु",
        "latin": "caṃdrana melè nèṭṭagè niṃtu"
      },
      "type": "poem_line"
    },
    {
      "id": "poem-s4l2",
      "section": "poem",
      "stanza": 4,
      "text": "ಭೂಮಿಯ ಕಡೆಗೆ ನೋಡಿದರೆ",
      "translations": {
        "en": "when she looked toward the earth",
        "hi": "धरती की ओर देखा तो"
      },
      "transliterations": {
        "devanagari": "भूमिय कडॆगॆ नोडिदरॆ",
        "latin": "bhūmiya kaḍègè noḍidarè"
      },
      "type": "poem_line"
    },
    {
      "id": "poem-s4l3",
      "section": "poem",
      "stanza": 4,
      "text": "ನೇರಳೆ ಬಣ್ಣದ ಚೆಂಡಿನ ಹಾಗೆ",
      "translations": {
        "en": "like a purple-coloured ball",
        "hi": "बैंगनी रंग की गेंद की तरह"
      },
      "transliterations": {
        "devanagari": "नेरळॆ बण्णद चॆंडिन हागॆ",
        "latin": "neraḻè baṇṇada cèṃḍina hāgè"
      },
      "type": "poem_line"
    },
    {
      "id": "poem-s4l4",
      "section": "poem",
      "stanza": 4,
      "text": "ಕಂಡಿತು ಅವಳಿಗೆ ನಮ್ಮ ಧರೆ.",
      "translations": {
        "en": "our earth appeared to her.",
        "hi": "उसे हमारी धरती दिखी।"
      },
      "transliterations": {
        "devanagari": "कंडितु अवळिगॆ नम्म धरॆ.",
        "latin": "kaṃḍitu avaḻigè namma dharè."
      },
      "type": "poem_line"
    },
    {
      "id": "poem-s5l1",
      "section": "poem",
      "stanza": 5,
      "text": "ಚಂದ್ರನ ಬಿಟ್ಟು ಮೇಲಕೆ ಹಾರಿ",
      "translations": {
        "en": "Leaving the moon flying higher",
        "hi": "चंद्र छोड़ ऊपर उड़"
      },
      "transliterations": {
        "devanagari": "चंद्रन बिट्टु मेलकॆ हारि",
        "latin": "caṃdrana biṭṭu melakè hāri"
      },
      "type": "poem_line"
    },
    {
      "id": "poem-s5l2",
      "section": "poem",
      "stanza": 5,
      "text": "ಸೇರಲು ಮಂಗಳನಂಗಳವ",
      "translations": {
        "en": "to reach the plains of Mars",
        "hi": "मंगल के मैदान पहुँचने"
      },
      "transliterations": {
        "devanagari": "सेरलु मंगळनंगळव",
        "latin": "seralu maṃgaḻanaṃgaḻava"
      },
      "type": "poem_line"
    },
    {
      "id": "poem-s5l3",
      "section": "poem",
      "stanza": 5,
      "text": "ಕೆಂಪಗೆ ಬಣಬಣಗುಟ್ಟುತಲಿತ್ತು",
      "translations": {
        "en": "it glowed red and empty",
        "hi": "लाल खाली चमक रहा था"
      },
      "transliterations": {
        "devanagari": "कॆंपगॆ बणबणगुट्टुतलित्तु",
        "latin": "kèṃpagè baṇabaṇaguṭṭutalittu"
      },
      "type": "poem_line"
    },
    {
      "id": "poem-s5l4",
      "section": "poem",
      "stanza": 5,
      "text": "ಕಾಣಲಿಲ್ಲ ಯಾವುದೆ ಜೀವ",
      "translations": {
        "en": "no life was to be seen",
        "hi": "कोई जीवन नहीं दिखी"
      },
      "transliterations": {
        "devanagari": "काणलिल्ल यावुदॆ जीव",
        "latin": "kāṇalilla yāvudè jīva"
      },
      "type": "poem_line"
    },
    {
      "id": "poem-s6l1",
      "section": "poem",
      "stanza": 6,
      "text": "ಪುಟ್ಟಿಯು ಕಂಡಳು ಮಂಗಳನಲ್ಲಿ",
      "translations": {
        "en": "On Mars Putti saw",
        "hi": "मंगल पर पुट्टी ने देखा"
      },
      "transliterations": {
        "devanagari": "पुट्टियु कंडळु मंगळनल्लि",
        "latin": "puṭṭiyu kaṃḍaḻu maṃgaḻanalli"
      },
      "type": "poem_line"
    },
    {
      "id": "poem-s6l2",
      "section": "poem",
      "stanza": 6,
      "text": "‘ಯೋಗಿ’ ಹೆಸರಿನ ಹೆಬ್ಬಂಡೆ",
      "translations": {
        "en": "a great rock named ‘Yogi’",
        "hi": "‘योगी’ नाम की बड़ी चट्टान"
      },
      "transliterations": {
        "devanagari": "‘योगि’ हॆसरिन हॆब्बंडॆ",
        "latin": "‘yogi’ hèsarina hèbbaṃḍè"
      },
      "type": "poem_line"
    },
    {
      "id": "poem-s6l3",
      "section": "poem",
      "stanza": 6,
      "text": "ಒಡನೆ ಕೇಳಿದಳು ಕೆಂಪು ಬಂಡೆಯನು",
      "translations": {
        "en": "At once she asked the red rock",
        "hi": "तुरंत लाल चट्टान से पूछा"
      },
      "transliterations": {
        "devanagari": "ऒडनॆ केळिदळु कॆंपु बंडॆयनु",
        "latin": "òḍanè keḻidaḻu kèṃpu baṃḍèyanu"
      },
      "type": "poem_line"
    },
    {
      "id": "poem-s6l4",
      "section": "poem",
      "stanza": 6,
      "text": "‘ನೀನು ಹೇಗೆ ಇಲ್ಲಿಗೆ ಬಂದೆ?’",
      "translations": {
        "en": "‘How did you come here?’",
        "hi": "‘तुम यहाँ कैसे आए?’"
      },
      "transliterations": {
        "devanagari": "‘नीनु हेगॆ इल्लिगॆ बंदॆ?’",
        "latin": "‘nīnu hegè illigè baṃdè?’"
      },
      "type": "poem_line"
    },
    {
      "id": "poem-s7l1",
      "section": "poem",
      "stanza": 7,
      "text": "ಬಂಡೆಯು ಕಣ್ಣೀರನು ಸುರಿಸುತ್ತಾ",
      "translations": {
        "en": "The rock shedding tears",
        "hi": "चट्टान आँसू बहाते"
      },
      "transliterations": {
        "devanagari": "बंडॆयु कण्णीरनु सुरिसुत्ता",
        "latin": "baṃḍèyu kaṇṇīranu surisuttā"
      },
      "type": "poem_line"
    },
    {
      "id": "poem-s7l2",
      "section": "poem",
      "stanza": 7,
      "text": "ಹೇಳಿತು ಪುಟ್ಟಿಗೆ ನೋವಿನಲಿ",
      "translations": {
        "en": "told Putti in pain",
        "hi": "दर्द में पुट्टी से कहा"
      },
      "transliterations": {
        "devanagari": "हेळितु पुट्टिगॆ नोविनलि",
        "latin": "heḻitu puṭṭigè novinali"
      },
      "type": "poem_line"
    },
    {
      "id": "poem-s7l3",
      "section": "poem",
      "stanza": 7,
      "text": "‘ಪುಟ್ಟಿಯೇ, ನಮ್ಮೀ ಮಂಗಳ ಗ್ರಹದ",
      "translations": {
        "en": "‘Putti, of this Mars of ours",
        "hi": "‘पुट्टी, हमारे इस मंगल की"
      },
      "transliterations": {
        "devanagari": "‘पुट्टिये, नम्मी मंगळ ग्रहद",
        "latin": "‘puṭṭiye, nammī maṃgaḻa grahada"
      },
      "type": "poem_line"
    },
    {
      "id": "poem-s7l4",
      "section": "poem",
      "stanza": 7,
      "text": "ದುರಂತ ಕಥೆಯನು ಕೇಳಿ ತಿಳಿ’",
      "translations": {
        "en": "hear and know the tragic tale’",
        "hi": "दुखांत कथा सुनकर जान’"
      },
      "transliterations": {
        "devanagari": "दुरंत कथॆयनु केळि तिळि’",
        "latin": "duraṃta kathèyanu keḻi tiḻi’"
      },
      "type": "poem_line"
    },
    {
      "id": "poem-s8l1",
      "section": "poem",
      "stanza": 8,
      "text": "ಹಿಂದೊಂದು ಕಾಲದಿ ಈ ಗ್ರಹದಲ್ಲಿ",
      "translations": {
        "en": "Once upon a time on this planet",
        "hi": "एक समय इस ग्रह पर"
      },
      "transliterations": {
        "devanagari": "हिंदॊंदु कालदि ई ग्रहदल्लि",
        "latin": "hiṃdòṃdu kāladi ī grahadalli"
      },
      "type": "poem_line"
    },
    {
      "id": "poem-s8l2",
      "section": "poem",
      "stanza": 8,
      "text": "ಇತ್ತು ಜೀವಜಲ ಹಸಿರು ಮರ",
      "translations": {
        "en": "there was living water and green trees",
        "hi": "जीवन जल और हरे पेड़ थे"
      },
      "transliterations": {
        "devanagari": "इत्तु जीवजल हसिरु मर",
        "latin": "ittu jīvajala hasiru mara"
      },
      "type": "poem_line"
    },
    {
      "id": "poem-s8l3",
      "section": "poem",
      "stanza": 8,
      "text": "ಆಗಿನ ಜನತೆಯು ನಾಡನು ಕಟ್ಟಲು",
      "translations": {
        "en": "Then people to build the land",
        "hi": "तब लोगों ने देश बनाने"
      },
      "transliterations": {
        "devanagari": "आगिन जनतॆयु नाडनु कट्टलु",
        "latin": "āgina janatèyu nāḍanu kaṭṭalu"
      },
      "type": "poem_line"
    },
    {
      "id": "poem-s8l4",
      "section": "poem",
      "stanza": 8,
      "text": "ಮರಗಳ ಕಡಿಯೆ ಬಂತು ಬರ",
      "translations": {
        "en": "cut the trees and drought came",
        "hi": "पेड़ काटे और अकाल आया"
      },
      "transliterations": {
        "devanagari": "मरगळ कडियॆ बंतु बर",
        "latin": "maragaḻa kaḍiyè baṃtu bara"
      },
      "type": "poem_line"
    },
    {
      "id": "poem-s9l1",
      "section": "poem",
      "stanza": 9,
      "text": "ಮಳೆ ಬೆಳೆ ಕಾಣದೆ ಜೀವಿಯು ಅಳಿದು",
      "translations": {
        "en": "Without rain and crops life died",
        "hi": "बिना वर्षा-फसल जीवन मरा"
      },
      "transliterations": {
        "devanagari": "मळॆ बॆळॆ काणदॆ जीवियु अळिदु",
        "latin": "maḻè bèḻè kāṇadè jīviyu aḻidu"
      },
      "type": "poem_line"
    },
    {
      "id": "poem-s9l2",
      "section": "poem",
      "stanza": 9,
      "text": "ಬಂದಿತು ನಮಗೆ ಇಂಥ ಸ್ಥಿತಿ",
      "translations": {
        "en": "and we came to such a state",
        "hi": "और हम ऐसी स्थिति में आए"
      },
      "transliterations": {
        "devanagari": "बंदितु नमगॆ इंथ स्थिति",
        "latin": "baṃditu namagè iṃtha sthiti"
      },
      "type": "poem_line"
    },
    {
      "id": "poem-s9l3",
      "section": "poem",
      "stanza": 9,
      "text": "‘ನಿಮ್ಮ ಭೂಮಿಯಲಿ ಗಿಡಮರ ಅಳಿದರೆ",
      "translations": {
        "en": "‘If trees die on your earth",
        "hi": "‘तुम्हारी धरती पर पेड़ मरें तो"
      },
      "transliterations": {
        "devanagari": "‘निम्म भूमियलि गिडमर अळिदरॆ",
        "latin": "‘nimma bhūmiyali giḍamara aḻidarè"
      },
      "type": "poem_line"
    },
    {
      "id": "poem-s9l4",
      "section": "poem",
      "stanza": 9,
      "text": "ಮುಂದೆ ಒಂದು ದಿನ ಇದೇ ಗತಿ’",
      "translations": {
        "en": "one day ahead this same fate’",
        "hi": "आगे एक दिन यही गति’"
      },
      "transliterations": {
        "devanagari": "मुंदॆ ऒंदु दिन इदे गति’",
        "latin": "muṃdè òṃdu dina ide gati’"
      },
      "type": "poem_line"
    },
    {
      "id": "poem-s10l1",
      "section": "poem",
      "stanza": 10,
      "text": "ಬಣಬಣಗುಟ್ಟುವ ಬಯಲನು ಕಂಡು",
      "translations": {
        "en": "Seeing the empty glowing plain",
        "hi": "खाली चमकता मैदान देख"
      },
      "transliterations": {
        "devanagari": "बणबणगुट्टुव बयलनु कंडु",
        "latin": "baṇabaṇaguṭṭuva bayalanu kaṃḍu"
      },
      "type": "poem_line"
    },
    {
      "id": "poem-s10l2",
      "section": "poem",
      "stanza": 10,
      "text": "ಢವಢವಗುಟ್ಟಿತು ಎಳೆ ಹೃದಯ",
      "translations": {
        "en": "the tender heart pounded",
        "hi": "कोमल हृदय धड़का"
      },
      "transliterations": {
        "devanagari": "ढवढवगुट्टितु ऎळॆ हृदय",
        "latin": "ḍhavaḍhavaguṭṭitu èḻè hṛdaya"
      },
      "type": "poem_line"
    },
    {
      "id": "poem-s10l3",
      "section": "poem",
      "stanza": 10,
      "text": "ಹಸಿರನು ಅಳಿಸದೆ ಗಿಡಮರ ಬೆಳೆಸಿ",
      "translations": {
        "en": "Without erasing green, growing trees",
        "hi": "हरा मिटाए बिना पेड़ उगाकर"
      },
      "transliterations": {
        "devanagari": "हसिरनु अळिसदॆ गिडमर बॆळॆसि",
        "latin": "hasiranu aḻisadè giḍamara bèḻèsi"
      },
      "type": "poem_line"
    },
    {
      "id": "poem-s10l4",
      "section": "poem",
      "stanza": 10,
      "text": "ಉಳಿಸುವೆವೆಂದಳು ಈ ಧರೆಯ",
      "translations": {
        "en": "she said we will save this earth",
        "hi": "कहा हम इस धरती को बचाएँगे"
      },
      "transliterations": {
        "devanagari": "उळिसुवॆवॆंदळु ई धरॆय",
        "latin": "uḻisuvèvèṃdaḻu ī dharèya"
      },
      "type": "poem_line"
    },
    {
      "id": "poem-s11l1",
      "section": "poem",
      "stanza": 11,
      "text": "ಭೂಮಿಗೆ ಬಂದು ಜನತೆಯ ಕಂಡು",
      "translations": {
        "en": "Coming to earth she met people",
        "hi": "धरती आकर लोगों से मिली"
      },
      "transliterations": {
        "devanagari": "भूमिगॆ बंदु जनतॆय कंडु",
        "latin": "bhūmigè baṃdu janatèya kaṃḍu"
      },
      "type": "poem_line"
    },
    {
      "id": "poem-s11l2",
      "section": "poem",
      "stanza": 11,
      "text": "ಹಸಿರನು ಉಳಿಸಲು ಬೇಡಿದಳು",
      "translations": {
        "en": "and begged them to save the green",
        "hi": "हरा बचाने की विनती की"
      },
      "transliterations": {
        "devanagari": "हसिरनु उळिसलु बेडिदळु",
        "latin": "hasiranu uḻisalu beḍidaḻu"
      },
      "type": "poem_line"
    },
    {
      "id": "poem-s11l3",
      "section": "poem",
      "stanza": 11,
      "text": "ತಾನು ಕೂಡ ಎಳೆ ಸಸಿಗಳ ನೆಟ್ಟು",
      "translations": {
        "en": "She too planted tender saplings",
        "hi": "वह भी कोमल पौधे लगाकर"
      },
      "transliterations": {
        "devanagari": "तानु कूड ऎळॆ ससिगळ नॆट्टु",
        "latin": "tānu kūḍa èḻè sasigaḻa nèṭṭu"
      },
      "type": "poem_line"
    },
    {
      "id": "poem-s11l4",
      "section": "poem",
      "stanza": 11,
      "text": "ಬೆಳೆಸುತ ಕುಣಿ ಕುಣಿದಾಡಿದಳು.",
      "translations": {
        "en": "grew them and danced for joy.",
        "hi": "उगाते नाचने लगी।"
      },
      "transliterations": {
        "devanagari": "बॆळॆसुत कुणि कुणिदाडिदळु.",
        "latin": "bèḻèsuta kuṇi kuṇidāḍidaḻu."
      },
      "type": "poem_line"
    },
    {
      "id": "author-1",
      "section": "author",
      "text": "ಸಿ.ಎಂ. ಗೋವಿಂದರೆಡ್ಡಿ ಅವರು 11-08-1958ರಲ್ಲಿ ಕೋಲಾರ ಜಿಲ್ಲೆಯ ಮಾಲೂರು ತಾಲೂಕಿನ ಚೆನ್ನಿಗರಾಯಪುರ ಎಂಬ ಊರಿನಲ್ಲಿ ಜನಿಸಿದರು. ಮಕ್ಕಳ ಸಾಹಿತ್ಯ ರಚನೆಯಲ್ಲಿ ವಿಶೇಷ ಆಸಕ್ತಿ ಹೊಂದಿದ ಇವರು ‘ಬಣ್ಣದ ಚಿಟ್ಟೆ’, ‘ಮಕ್ಕಳ ಮಂದಾರ’, ‘ಪದ್ಯ ಹೇಳುವ ಮರ’ ಮೊದಲಾದ ಕೃತಿಗಳನ್ನು ರಚಿಸಿದ್ದಾರೆ. ಪ್ರಸ್ತುತ ಪದ್ಯವನ್ನು ‘ಮಕ್ಕಳ ಮಂದಾರ’ ಎಂಬ ಕೃತಿಯಿಂದ ಆಯ್ಕೆಮಾಡಿಕೊಳ್ಳಲಾಗಿದೆ.",
      "translations": {
        "en": "C.M. Govinda Reddy was born on 11-08-1958 in Chennigarayapura, Malur taluk, Kolar district. He has special interest in children’s literature and has written works such as Bannada Chitte, Makkala Mandara and Padya Heluva Mara. This poem is chosen from ‘Makkala Mandara’.",
        "hi": "सी.एम. गोविंदरेड्डी का जन्म 11-08-1958 को कोलार जिले के मालूर तालुक के चेन्निगरायपुर में हुआ। बाल साहित्य में विशेष रुचि; बण्णद चिट्टे, मक्कळ मंदार, पद्य हेळुव मर आदि कृतियाँ। यह पद्य ‘मक्कळ मंदार’ से लिया गया।"
      },
      "transliterations": {
        "devanagari": "सि.ऎं. गोविंदरॆड्डि अवरु 11-08-1958रल्लि कोलार जिल्लॆय मालूरु तालूकिन चॆन्निगरायपुर ऎंब ऊरिनल्लि जनिसिदरु. मक्कळ साहित्य रचनॆयल्लि विशेष आसक्ति हॊंदिद इवरु ‘बण्णद चिट्टॆ’, ‘मक्कळ मंदार’, ‘पद्य हेळुव मर’ मॊदलाद कृतिगळन्नु रचिसिद्दारॆ. प्रस्तुत पद्यवन्नु ‘मक्कळ मंदार’ ऎंब कृतियिंद आय्कॆमाडिकॊळ्ळलागिदॆ.",
        "latin": "si.èṃ. goviṃdarèḍḍi avaru 11-08-1958ralli kolāra jillèya mālūru tālūkina cènnigarāyapura èṃba ūrinalli janisidaru. makkaḻa sāhitya racanèyalli viśeṣa āsakti hòṃdida ivaru ‘baṇṇada ciṭṭè’, ‘makkaḻa maṃdāra’, ‘padya heḻuva mara’ mòdalāda kṛtigaḻannu racisiddārè. prastuta padyavannu ‘makkaḻa maṃdāra’ èṃba kṛtiyiṃda āykèmāḍikòḻḻalāgidè."
      },
      "type": "prose"
    },
    {
      "id": "vocab-agasa",
      "section": "vocab",
      "text": "ಆಗಸ",
      "translations": {
        "en": "āgasa",
        "hi": "आगस"
      },
      "transliterations": {
        "devanagari": "आगस",
        "latin": "āgasa"
      },
      "type": "vocabulary_term"
    },
    {
      "id": "vocab-agasa-def",
      "section": "vocab",
      "text": "ಆಕಾಶ, ಗಗನ",
      "translations": {
        "en": "sky, firmament",
        "hi": "आकाश, गगन"
      },
      "transliterations": {
        "devanagari": "आकाश, गगन",
        "latin": "ākāśa, gagana"
      },
      "type": "vocabulary_definition"
    },
    {
      "id": "vocab-ishta",
      "section": "vocab",
      "text": "ಇಷ್ಟ",
      "translations": {
        "en": "iṣṭa",
        "hi": "इष्ट"
      },
      "transliterations": {
        "devanagari": "इष्ट",
        "latin": "iṣṭa"
      },
      "type": "vocabulary_term"
    },
    {
      "id": "vocab-ishta-def",
      "section": "vocab",
      "text": "ಇಚ್ಛೆ, ಮೆಚ್ಚುಗೆ",
      "translations": {
        "en": "wish, liking",
        "hi": "इच्छॆ, मॆच्चुगॆ"
      },
      "transliterations": {
        "devanagari": "इच्छॆ, मॆच्चुगॆ",
        "latin": "icchè, mèccugè"
      },
      "type": "vocabulary_definition"
    },
    {
      "id": "vocab-rekke",
      "section": "vocab",
      "text": "ರೆಕ್ಕೆ",
      "translations": {
        "en": "rèkkè",
        "hi": "रॆक्कॆ"
      },
      "transliterations": {
        "devanagari": "रॆक्कॆ",
        "latin": "rèkkè"
      },
      "type": "vocabulary_term"
    },
    {
      "id": "vocab-rekke-def",
      "section": "vocab",
      "text": "ಹಕ್ಕಿಗಳ ಪುಕ್ಕ, ಗರಿ",
      "translations": {
        "en": "bird’s feather, wing",
        "hi": "हक्किगळ पुक्क, गरि"
